f the Shareholder for the London & Middlesex Community Housing:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0the 2022 Annual General Meeting of the Shareholder for the London & Middlesex Community Housing BE HELD at a meeting of the Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee on June 20, 2023, for the purpose of receiving the report from the Board of Directors of the London & Middlesex Community Housing in accordance with the Shareholder Declaration and the Business Corporations Act, R.S.O. 1990, c. B.16; and,", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b) \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0the City Clerk BE DIRECTED to provide notice of the 2022 Annual Meeting to the Board of Directors for the London & Middlesex Community Housing and to invite the Chair of the Board and the Executive Director of the London & Middlesex Community Housing to attend at the Annual Meeting and present the report of the Board in accordance with the Shareholder Declaration;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "it being noted that the Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee received a communication dated March 15, 2023, from P. Chisholm, Chief Executive Officer, London & Middlesex Community Housing, with respect to this matter.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira,C. Rahman"]}, {"vote": "Absent:", "voters": ["E. Peloza"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (14 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2023-03-28 16:00:00", "attachments": [{"empty_flag": false, "title": "2023-03-28 Submission - Request for Shareholders Meeting-LMCH", "url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/filestream.ashx?DocumentId=98290", "date": "2023-03-28 00:00:00", "local_page": null, "__class__": "Attachment"}], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "datetime": "2023-03-28 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "5": {"title": "Deferred Matters/Additional Business", "number": "5", "content": [], "items": {"1": {"title": "(ADDED) Request to Declare a State of Emergency regarding Housing", "number": "1", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Franke", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by C. Rahman", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That, the following actions be taken with respect the Request to Declare a State of Emergency Regarding Housing:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "a) \u00a0 \u00a0the presentations from Claire Wittnebel and Jeff Hanks, Co-organizer, London Regional Social Forum with respect to declaring a State of Emergency Regarding Housing BE RECEIVED;", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "b) \u00a0 \u00a0Council recognizes that there is an untenable emergency in our city related to housing and homelessness.\u00a0 Therefore, Council remains committed to addressing this significant issue, and the following concrete actions BE ENDORSED:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "i) \u00a0 \u00a0supporting the Whole of Community System Response, including allocating $2.8 million to kickstart work and committing to future funding;\n\nii) \u00a0 \u00a0advocating to provincial and federal government for more funding and support in building affordable housing and to provide increased levels of healthcare to assist with mental health and addiction\n\niii)\u00a0 \u00a0achieving our Roadmap to 3,000 affordable housing units by 2026;\n\niv)\u00a0 \u00a0achieving our Housing Pledge of 47,000 in the next decade;\n\nv) \u00a0 \u00a0working with and supporting non-profits who are providing housing and support services; and\n\nvi)\u00a0 \u00a0other opportunities to find housing and homelessness solutions.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira,C. Rahman"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (15 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "At 4:35 PM, His Worship Mayor J. Morgan, places Councillor E. Peloza in the Chair.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"string": "At 4:40 PM, His Worship Mayor J. Morgan resumes the Chair.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [{"string": "ADDITIONAL VOTES:", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by D. Ferreira", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by H. McAlister", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the delegations regarding housing BE APPROVED to be heard at this time.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "E. Peloza", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira,C. Rahman"]}, {"vote": "Nays:", "voters": ["P. Cuddy"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (14 to 1)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2023-03-28 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "datetime": "2023-03-28 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "6": {"title": "Confidential (Enclosed for Members only.)", "number": "6", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by C. Rahman", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by S. Trosow", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee convenes In Closed Session to consider the following:\n\n\n\n6.1\u00a0 Personal Matters/Identifiable Individual\n\n\n\nA matter pertaining to personal matters, including information regarding an identifiable individual, with respect to employment-related matters; advice or recommendations of officers and employees of the Corporation, including communications necessary for that purpose and for the purpose of providing instructions and directions to officers and employees of the Corporation.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Morgan", "A. Hopkins", "S. Lewis", "S. Hillier", "P. Van Meerbergen", "S. Lehman", "H. McAlister", "P. Cuddy", "S. Stevenson", "J. Pribil", "S. Trosow", "S. Franke", "D. Ferreira,C. Rahman"]}, {"vote": "Absent:", "voters": ["E. Peloza"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed (14 to 0)", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "The Strategic Priorities and Policy Committee convenes In Closed Session from 9:11 PM to 10:09 PM.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2023-03-28 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "7": {"title": "Adjournment", "number": "7", "content": [{"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by S. Franke", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by D. Ferreira", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "That the meeting BE ADJOURNED.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [{"string": "The meeting adjourned at 10:09 PM.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": "2023-03-28 16:00:00", "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}}, "__class__": "Meeting"}